# The upkeep ability exiles the top card face down and lets Bot1 look at and play it THIS turn. Turn 3's card is Lightning Bolt,
# cast from exile (a spell, not only a land) with Mox Ruby at Bot2: 17. Turn 5's card is a Plains that Bot1 does not play;
# the permission ended with that turn, so on turn 7 the Plains cannot be played (refusal) while turn 7's own exiled Island,
# the positive control, can.

[Bot1 Deck]
